1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:00,950
Hand flat,

2
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:01,873
fold your middle finger

3
00:00:01,873 --> 00:00:02,500
under,

4
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,701
now lift your RING finger.

5
00:00:04,701 --> 00:00:05,540
Stuck?

6
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,400
Relax,

7
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,640
it's on a leash...

8
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,767
held by your middle finger.

9
00:00:09,803 --> 00:00:11,233
See the cords on your hand?

10
00:00:11,233 --> 00:00:12,920
They lift your fingers.

11
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:13,681
Pointer and pinky

12
00:00:13,681 --> 00:00:15,410
get a spare lifter each.

13
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:16,410
Ring finger?

14
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,097
Nope.

15
00:00:17,097 --> 00:00:18,003
And a strap ties it

16
00:00:18,003 --> 00:00:19,180
to the middle one.

17
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,100
Middle down...

18
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,167
ring down.

19
00:00:21,201 --> 00:00:22,524
In the eighteen-eighties,

20
00:00:22,524 --> 00:00:23,800
a surgeon snipped

21
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,915
those straps for pianists...

22
00:00:25,915 --> 00:00:27,540
on purpose.

23
00:00:27,734 --> 00:00:28,660
Still trying,

24
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:29,834
aren't you?

